{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["The sister of Nevayot — because he was the firstborn of the sons of Yishmael, he calls her 'the sister of Nevayot.' And similarly: ותקח מרים הנביאה אחות אהרן — because Aharon was born before Moshe, he calls her 'the sister of Aharon.' But in a place where Moshe and Aharon are mentioned in a single verse, he calls her 'their sister,' as written: ותלד לעמרם את אהרן ואת משה ואת מרים אחותם. And similarly: ואחות לוטן תמנע — because he was the first, as written: לוטן ושובל וצבעון וענה."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:31.217345153Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}